=== WEEKLY SYNTHESIS TASK ===

Analyse the last 7 days of OS data below. Produce exactly 3 cross-domain insights. Each insight must connect signals from at least two different domains (e.g. a Zara signal + a Nell outreach gap, or a Vera audit finding + a product health issue + a market window). Insights must be specific and actionable. Summaries are a failure.

